0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 택배비 건당 5,500원(동일 주소지라도 20kg마다 택배비 5,500원 각각 부과)</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 제주도, 도서/산간 지역은 택배비용이 추가될 수 있음</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">3. 주문기간 및 방법</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; 가. 주문기간:&nbsp;<span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2026. 1. 21.(수) ~ 1. 31.(목) 17:00까지</span></span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; 나. 주문방법: 신청 양식(붙임)을 작성하여 구디 farm 메일(<span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">farm@goodee.ac.kr</span>)로 발송</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4. 배부방법</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; 가. 택배발송: 도정일이후 신청 주소지로 택배발송</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; 나. 직접수령: 도정일이후 서울캠퍼스 내 배부장소, 시간 별도 안내 예정</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: bold;\">5. 정산:</span>&nbsp;수령 이후 급여 공제(급여 공제 불가한 경우 계좌 이체)</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: bold;\">6. 문의:</span>&nbsp;(전화) 02-450-3724</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">붙임&nbsp; 2026년 1월 햅쌀(2025년생산) 신청서 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</span></p>', '2026-01-21 15:12:34', '0', '1', 'N'),
