&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">2026.&nbsp;1학기 재입학생</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 24px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- 차액고지자(전과, 소속변경 등)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 24px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- 신한은행 헤이영 서비스 이용자</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.2; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.2; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">2) 신청안내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; 