-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 21.3333px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">5) 분할납부 유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 37px; padding: 0px; line-height: 21.3333px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; text-indent: -28.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;■</span><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: red;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: bold;\">등록금 전액 완납 또는 분할납부 1차분을 정해진 기간에 미납할 경우 분할납부 신청은 자동 취소되며, 미납 등록금은 이후 추가 등록기간에 전액 납부해야 함&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 37px; padding: 0px; line-height: 21.3333px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; text-indent: -28.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;■&nbsp;<span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: bold;\">분할납부 신청 시 인적사항을 미기재하거나, 내용이 불분명할 경우 신청이 취소될 수 있음</span></span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 37px; padding: 0px; line-height: 21.3333px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; text-indent: -28.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt; text-indent: -37.4667px;\">&nbsp;■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">분할납부는 현금납부제이므로 신용카드로 납부 불가함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 37px; padding: 0px; line-height: 21.3333px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; text-indent: -28.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt; text-indent: -37.4667px;\">&nbsp;■&nbsp;<span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\">분할납부 미신청 혹은 승인이 취소된 경우, 신용카드(삼성카드만 가능) 납부 시 할부 납부 가능(3번항 참조)</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 37px; padding: 0px; line-height: 21.3333px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; text-indent: -28.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;■ 휴학 및 자퇴는 4차분 분할납부 등록금까지 일괄 완납해야 가능<br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 37px; padding: 0px; line-height: 21.3333px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; text-indent: -28.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;■ 분할납부 등록금을 완납하지 않을 경우 미등록 제적 처리</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 37px; padding: 0px; line-height: 21.3333px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; text-indent: -28.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;■<span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: bold;\">분할납부 2~4차 지연 납부할 경우 1년간 분할납부 신청 자격 상실</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 37px; padding: 0px; line-height: 21.3333px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; text-indent: -28.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;■ 학사업무의 원활한 진행을 위하여 등록금 분할납부 인원을 제한할 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 23.4667px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></p><table style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; width: 1310px; border-spacing: 0px; table-layout: fixed; text-align: center; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 18px; font-family: 굴림; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial;\"><tbody style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"><tr style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"><td style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; height: 42px; padding: 1px 6px; vertical-align: middle;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.2; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; height: 42px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: 400; background: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 15px 20px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 16pt;\">7</span></span><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 16pt;\">등록 유의사항</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 37px; padding: 0px; line-height: 21.3333px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; text-indent: -28.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">1) 기간 내 미등록 시 제적처리 되므로 등록금 납부 또는 휴학신청 요망</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 37px; padding: 0px; line-height: 21.3333px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; text-indent: -28.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">2) 전용계좌 입금은 아래와 같이 선택 입금 가능</span><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: red;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">(기타납입금 선 입금 불가)</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 37px; padding: 0px; line-height: 21.3333px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; text-indent: -28.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: red;\"></span><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-decoration-line: underline; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">① 등록금+기타납입금, ② 등록금, ③ 등록금 입금완료 후 기타납입금 추가</span></span><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">입금</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothi