ly: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\">증명서 발급 업체의 IDC 서버 이전 작업으로 인해,&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\">아래와 같이 증명서 발급 서비스가 일시 중단될 예정이오니 이용에 참고하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\">1. 중단 일시</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); font-weight: bold;\">2026. 2. 14.(토) 00:00 ~ 2026. 2. 16.(월) 12:00</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\">2. 중단 서비스</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\">가. 인터넷 증명발급 서비스</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\">나. 창구/무인증명발급기 서비스<br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\">다. 증명서 온라인 제출 서비스(첨부서비스)</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\">라. 대외 연계 증명서 발급 서비스</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span 