ft: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\">감사합니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Light&quot;; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 28.8px;\"><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\">- 교무처 학사팀 -</span></p><div><span style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></div>', '2026-01-21 15:22:58', '5', '1', 'Y'),
